{
  "video_id": "cNgEUKVYkCU",
  "title": "Never Say \"What?\" When You Don't Hear Someone | Here's Why #SpeakingHabits",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-27 20:07:53",
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.53,
      "en": "On a video call,",
      "zh": "有一次在視訊通話裡，"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 1.53,
      "end": 3.109,
      "en": "a learner missed one word",
      "zh": "有個學生只漏聽了一個字，"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 3.109,
      "end": 4.61,
      "en": "and said,",
      "zh": "就直接大聲回了句：「蛤？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 4.61,
      "end": 4.6899999999999995,
      "en": "\"What?",
      "zh": "結果他的外國同事當場愣住，"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 5.769,
      "end": 8.539,
      "en": "Their coworker paused and asked,",
      "zh": "還問他："
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 8.539,
      "end": 9.269,
      "en": "\"Wait,",
      "zh": "「等等，"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 9.269,
      "end": 9.75,
      "en": "are you mad?",
      "zh": "你在生氣嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 10.8,
      "end": 11.769,
      "en": "Oh,",
      "zh": "噢，這種狀況真的超常發生！"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 11.769,
      "end": 13.539,
      "en": "that happens a lot!",
      "zh": "單看文法的話，"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 13.539,
      "end": 14.82,
      "en": "Grammatically,",
      "zh": "講「什麼？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 14.82,
      "end": 15.05,
      "en": "\"What?\"",
      "zh": "其實沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 15.05,
      "end": 16.25,
      "en": "is fine.",
      "zh": "但在母語人士聽起來，"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 17.12,
      "end": 18.579,
      "en": "But to native speakers,",
      "zh": "那感覺就像是在發\n脾氣或非常不禮貌！"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 18.579,
      "end": 20.179,
      "en": "it sounds angry or rude!",
      "zh": "真的假的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 21.19,
      "end": 22.519,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "那如果改說「對不起」呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 22.519,
      "end": 23.94,
      "en": "Then what about saying",
      "zh": "那也要小心喔！"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 23.94,
      "end": 24.64,
      "en": "\"I am sorry\"?",
      "zh": "如果你用很平淡的\n語調說「對不起」，"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 25.76,
      "end": 27.25,
      "en": "Careful!",
      "zh": "大家會以為你弄壞了什麼東西……"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 27.25,
      "end": 28.96,
      "en": "If you say a flat \"I",
      "zh": "……然後一臉莫名其妙地問你："
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 28.96,
      "end": 30.37,
      "en": "am sorry,\"",
      "zh": "「幹嘛道歉？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 30.37,
      "end": 31.649,
      "en": "people think you broke something...",
      "zh": "還真的耶！"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 31.649,
      "end": 33.219,
      "en": "and ask,",
      "zh": "那如果是跟熟識的朋友聊天，"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 33.219,
      "end": 33.539,
      "en": "\"What for?",
      "zh": "該怎麼說才自然？"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 34.53,
      "end": 35.679,
      "en": "Good catch!",
      "zh": "跟朋友的話，"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 35.679,
      "end": 37.64,
      "en": "So what should we say",
      "zh": "尾音要拉高，"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 37.64,
      "end": 38.079,
      "en": "with friends?",
      "zh": "說「不好意思？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 38.859,
      "end": 40.14,
      "en": "With friends,",
      "zh": "或是「你剛剛說什麼呀？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 40.14,
      "end": 42.299,
      "en": "use a rising tone:",
      "zh": "這樣聽起來就很溫暖又親切。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 42.299,
      "end": 42.56,
      "en": "\"Sorry?\"",
      "zh": "那如果是在很吵雜的店裡，"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 42.56,
      "end": 44.59,
      "en": "or \"What was that?",
      "zh": "或是跟陌生人說話呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 45.659,
      "end": 47.469,
      "en": "It sounds warm and friendly.",
      "zh": "你可以順口說："
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 48.34,
      "end": 50.71,
      "en": "What if you are in a noisy shop",
      "zh": "「抱歉，"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 50.71,
      "end": 52.609,
      "en": "or talking to a stranger?",
      "zh": "我剛剛沒聽清楚。」"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 53.719,
      "end": 54.439,
      "en": "Say,",
      "zh": "這等於是委婉地怪\n自己耳朵沒聽好，"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 54.439,
      "end": 55.09,
      "en": "\"Sorry,",
      "zh": "聽起來超自然的！"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 55.09,
      "end": 55.85,
      "en": "I didn't catch that.",
      "zh": "那要是換成很正式的商務會議呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 56.759,
      "end": 58.64,
      "en": "That blames your ears gently",
      "zh": "在職場上，"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 58.64,
      "end": 60.06,
      "en": "and sounds super natural!",
      "zh": "就要高雅地說："
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 61.1,
      "end": 63.469,
      "en": "And what about a serious work meeting?",
      "zh": "「可以請您再重複一次嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 64.45,
      "end": 65.18,
      "en": "At work,",
      "zh": "這樣講不僅展現尊重，"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 65.18,
      "end": 66.069,
      "en": "say,",
      "zh": "還顯得很沉穩得體。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 66.069,
      "end": 66.739,
      "en": "\"Could you say that again,",
      "zh": "太讚了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 66.739,
      "end": 67.0,
      "en": "please?",
      "zh": "那總結一下，"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 68.099,
      "end": 69.849,
      "en": "That sounds respectful and calm.",
      "zh": "今天的黃金法則是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 70.659,
      "end": 71.75,
      "en": "Love that!",
      "zh": "黃金法則就是："
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 71.75,
      "end": 73.319,
      "en": "What is today's golden rule?",
      "zh": "絕對不要劈頭就吼一句「蛤？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 74.2,
      "end": 75.909,
      "en": "Golden rule:",
      "zh": "記得用尾音上揚的「不好意思？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 75.909,
      "end": 77.73,
      "en": "Never shout \"What?",
      "zh": "或是「我剛剛沒聽清楚！」"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 79.129,
      "end": 80.519,
      "en": "Use a rising",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 80.519,
      "end": 81.239,
      "en": "\"Sorry?\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 81.239,
      "end": 83.9,
      "en": "or \"I didn't catch that!",
      "zh": ""
    }
  ]
}